# The preset ("shimmer": P1 180, P2 140, fully wet) on FX1 with a click train, like a melody's attacks sent to it: a
# ~6 s hall whose tail grows an octave halo that climbs and thins out into the highs.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 5
track fx1
input impulse 4 0.7
preset 180 140 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
expect sound 0 16
expect peak_below -6
